<Sec id="t-agreement" n="1" title="Agreement to these terms" short="By using Voqalize you accept these terms, for yourself or for the company you act for.">
  <p>We are Voqalize Technologies Private Limited ("Voqalize", "Company", "we", "us", "our"), a company registered in India with its registered office at 503, Block 17B, Suncity Apartments, HSR Layout, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560102, India. You can reach us by email at <Email address="support@voqalize.com" /> or by mail at the same address.</p>
  <p>We operate the website voqalize.com, the developer console, our APIs, SDKs, hosted voice runtime and MCP server, and any other products and services that refer or link to these terms (the "Legal Terms") (together, the "Services").</p>
  <p>These Legal Terms are a legally binding agreement between you, whether personally or on behalf of an entity ("you"), and Voqalize Technologies Private Limited, concerning your access to and use of the Services. If you accept them on behalf of a company or other entity, you confirm that you have authority to bind it, and "you" means that entity. By accessing the Services, you confirm that you have read, understood and agreed to be bound by all of these Legal Terms. If you do not agree with all of these Legal Terms, you are expressly prohibited from using the Services and you must stop using them immediately.</p>
  <p>The Services are intended for businesses and for individuals who are at least 18 years old. You may not create an account or accept these Legal Terms if you are under 18.</p>
</Sec>

<Sec id="t-services" n="2" title="Our services" short="Voqalize carries the voice side of a conversation for your app. Some regulated uses need a separate written agreement first.">
  <p>Voqalize is voice AI infrastructure. With <b>developer integration</b>, you connect your own AI agent (your "brain") and Voqalize handles the voice: the real-time session, speech to text, text to speech, turn-taking, interruptions, recording and the optional on-screen character. With <b>Plug &amp; Play</b>, Voqalize also manages the AI agent for you, using a language model and the instructions, knowledge and tools you configure.</p>
  <p>The information provided through the Services is not intended for distribution to or use by any person or entity in any jurisdiction where that would be contrary to law or would subject us to any registration requirement in that jurisdiction. Anyone who accesses the Services from other locations does so on their own initiative and is responsible for complying with local laws.</p>
  <p>The Services are not tailored to comply with industry-specific regulations such as the US Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA) or the Federal Information Security Management Act (FISMA). Voqalize does not offer a HIPAA Business Associate Agreement, so you must not use the Services to process protected health information under HIPAA unless Voqalize agrees otherwise in a signed agreement. If your use would be subject to any other such law, you may not use the Services for that purpose unless we have first signed a separate written agreement covering it. You may not use the Services in a way that would violate the Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act (GLBA).</p>
</Sec>

