  <p>You are responsible for all use of your account, your sign-in credentials and your API keys, including use by your team members and by software you deploy. Keep secret keys on your server and never in a browser or mobile app; use publishable keys with allowed origins for client code. Tell us promptly at support@voqalize.com if you believe a key or account has been compromised. We may suspend a key or account that we reasonably believe is compromised or misused.</p>
  <p>If you provide information that is untrue, inaccurate, not current or incomplete, we may suspend or terminate your account and refuse any current or future use of the Services.</p>
</Sec>

<Sec id="t-payment" n="4" title="Plans, purchases and payment" short="Plans and rates are on the pricing page. Payments are not refundable. Taxes are added where the law requires.">
  <p>The plans, included minutes, usage rates and limits for the Services are set out on our <a href="/pricing">pricing page</a> or in your order form. Usage above a plan's allowance, recording and storage are charged at the rates shown there.</p>
  <p>All purchases are non-refundable. We accept the following forms of payment: credit and debit cards, bank transfer and UPI. Payments are processed by our payment processors, Razorpay and Dodo Payments. Prices are charged in Indian rupees (INR) or US dollars (USD), as shown when you buy.</p>
  <p>You agree to provide current, complete and accurate purchase and account information, and to promptly update it, including your email address, payment method and card expiry date, so that we can complete your transactions and contact you as needed. Tax, including GST, will be added to the price as required by law. We may change prices at any time, and we will tell you before a change applies to a plan you have already bought.</p>
  <p>You agree to pay all charges at the prices then in effect, and you authorise us to charge your chosen payment provider for those amounts. We may correct any error in pricing, even after we have requested or received payment. We may refuse any order, and we may limit or cancel purchases that appear to be made by resellers or distributors without our agreement. If a payment is overdue, we may suspend the Services after giving you notice.</p>
</Sec>

